```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "prepare a waiting promotion with a reason, for the hand to commit"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.offer.prepares"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offer.prepares"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offer.prepares"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.offer.prepares ~ the AI prepares; the hand commits

Every wiki wears promotion capability; its edge holds (face, wiki, digest). The AI prepares and flags; the hand commits and raises. The wiki rides `--wiki` (absent: the daemon wiki), the face `--face N`, and every answer prints as JSON.

`trust prepare <digest> --why <reason>` puts a waiting item on the board with the reason it should be promoted; it commits nothing. A digest no waiting item carries refuses `promote-unknown`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ with-a-reason

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`with-a-reason` params=`digest/<digest> why/[[opens the field-notes macro]] ~ prepare one waiting item and say why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ digest · wiki · face · why

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`digest` params=`takes/hex64 needs/required seat/1 as/<digest> ~ the promotion's digest, 64 lowercase hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wiki` params=`takes/wiki-name ~ the wiki the promotion belongs to; absent, the daemon wiki`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ which face's promotion plane this call reads or acts on, by persona index (a whole number from 0)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`why` params=`takes/words needs/required ~ the reason the item should be promoted`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a preparation grants nothing: the hand's commit decides`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ promote-digest-malformed · promote-why-missing · promote-unknown

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-digest-malformed` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.prepares digest/<digest> why/<reason>]] ~ name a hex64 digest`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-why-missing` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.prepares digest/<digest> why/<reason>]] ~ name --why`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-unknown` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.reads]] ~ no waiting item carries the digest; list what waits`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ prepared

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`prepared` params=`exit/0 ~ the item stands prepared on the board; the answer prints as JSON`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares trust prepare

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares trust prepare]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

